ike these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Ok, we will send you jobs like this. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Open Date Close Date Instructional Student Assistant (Tutor) for The Kegley Center Bakersfield August 24, 2026 Open Until Filled ***OPEN TO CURRENT CSUB STUDENTS, CURRENTLY ENROLLED OR ELIGIBILE TO ENROLL ONLY*** \nTemporary hourly Instructional Student Assistant positions in Kegley Center for Student Success Current Opportunities Position Location Open Date Close Date Instructional Student Assistant (Tutor) for The Kegley Center Bakersfield August 24, 2026 Open Until Filled ***OPEN TO CURRENT CSUB STUDENTS, CURRENTLY ENROLLED OR ELIGIBILE TO ENROLL ONLY*** \nTemporary hourly Instructional Student Assistant positions in Kegley Center for Student Success Powered by PageUp - Read FAQs and browse answers to common questions If you have any questions, encounter problems, or need assistance, please email jobs@csub.edu . `Runners on the Rise! Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube Flickr California State University, Bakersfield 9001 Stockdale Highway Bakersfield, CA 93311 (661) 654-CSUB Apply Visit Contact Accessibility Annual Security Report Budget Central Campus Directory Campus Forms Careers DMCA/Copyright Emergency Info Library Maps Master Plan Plan an Event Policies Privacy Report a Website Issue Safety Plan Sitemap Strategic Plan Sustainability Title IX University Police © California State University, Bakersfield Adobe Reader | Microsoft Viewers We use cookies to make your website experience better. To learn about how we keep your information safe, view our Privacy Policy. Accept Privacy Policy"
